<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 185-4 V WEST INDIES (147) - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 185-4 V WEST INDIES (147) - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 185 for four in reply to West Indies's first innings score of 147 at lunch on the second day of the second test on Saturday.</p>
</text>
